From 09e49a8a50d3aa0badd2543dabf0de04a4754398 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:52:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Language packs: strings for the new kit pages, colour-blind
 mode and the Encrypted DNS VPN-server note

- The 25 packs gain the strings of the Printer Server, Time Machine, Speed, Operation Mode, AiMesh and Network kit
  pages, the Accessibility tab and RENC_112 (devices on a VPN server are answered inside the tunnel, as plain DNS).
  All 25 packs stay lockstep.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
